Troubleshooting Tips
Ceilometer not collecting data:

Verify RabbitMQ connection sudo rabbitmqctl list_connections
Check service logs journalctl -u ceilometer-*
Elasticsearch not starting:

Check Java version java -version (requires Java 11+)
Verify heap size in /etc/elasticsearch/jvm.options
Grafana authentication issues:

Reset admin password grafana-cli admin reset-admin-password newpassword
